file":"OutKast is an American hip-hop duo from Atlanta, Georgia, consisting of [a=Andre 3000] aka [a=Andre Benjamin] and [a=Big Boi] aka [a=Antwan Patton]. Formed in the early 1990s, they became pioneers of Southern hip-hop, blending funk, jazz, and electronic elements into their music. Their albums ATLiens (1996), Aquemini (1998), and Stankonia (2000) showcased their eclectic sound, while Speakerboxxx/The Love Below (2003) earned them a Grammy for Album of the Year. Known for hits like Ms. Jackson, Hey Ya!, and B.O.B., OutKast remains one of the most innovative and influential hip-hop acts of all time. OutKast went on hiatus after the release of their 2006 film and soundtrack Idlewild, as André 3000 and Big Boi pursued solo careers. While they reunited for a 2014 tour, no new music followed, and both artists have since focused on individual projects, effectively marking the end of the duo’s active collaboration.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:38561","relations":{"aliases":null,"groups":null,"members":[{"active":true,"id":187668,"name":"Andre Benjamin"},{"active":true,"id":654348,"name":"Antwan Patton"}],"namevariations":["Out Cast","Out Kast","OutKast Patti Labelle","Outcast","Outcaste","Outkast","Outkst","Uotkast","アウトキャスト","流浪者","流浪者合唱團"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/38561-OutKast","type":"artist","urls":["http://outkast.com","http://www.facebook.com/outkast","http://www.instagram.com/outkast","http://myspace.com/outkast","http://outkast.tumblr.com","http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Outkast","http://www.youtube.com/user/OutkastVEVO"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/4581123/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"4581123","image":"https://i.discogs.com/xnGEeNeKp5eWzkT3nKSPx1-fZBLbZatB99LTrrvSrC4/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:563/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTQ1ODEx/MjMtMTc1NjA2ODUz/OC02MTcwLmpwZWc.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/JXd8Og6YDn7wgy5ENZ0WhaX4Q948plTnv-NNgwWLxOo/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaX